  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">今天就在 Bisect Hosting 申請一台伺服器，和好友一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/buy me a coffee-support-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/870825743788158986?color=blue&amp;style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/my other-projects-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/get%20a%20server-click%20here-blue?style=plastic\" /></a><br />&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>DarkGlint</h2>\n<p><br />將原版附魔光澤改為較深的藍色星雲光澤 | <a href=\"https://www.gamerpotion.net/2023/08/darkglint-enchantment-glint.html\">查看更新日誌</a><em><br /></em></p>\n<p><em>此為僅限客戶端使用的模組</em></p>\n<p>本模組由打造 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的相同開發團隊製作（若追求完整 RPG 體驗，請下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，盡情享受任務與角色扮演玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h5>（憑藉以下功能，您的原版遊戲體驗將獲進一步提升）</h5>\n<h5>此功能會將您原本的原版附魔物品與盔甲光澤，替換成酷炫的深藍色星雲光澤，在昏暗環境下尤為出色！建議前往「無障礙設定」將「光澤強度」調整至 100%，以獲得最佳視覺效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/989/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977557893110964374/1135933208790323310/javaw_Tr5W8rud3d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"&quot;458\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/990/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>授權說明：歡迎自由將本模組用於您的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅立即購買伺服器！或前往 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;，並務必輸入代碼 '<strong>gamerpotion</strong>' 以享有 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
